  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Run this once\n\nSelect **Execute workflow** below. It creates the three local tables the\nmonthly update needs and does nothing else. Running it again is safe: it\nleaves existing tables and their contents alone.\n\nNothing here touches your email. This is local storage only.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -880,
        -260
      ],
      "id": "95600000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Start Here"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Then, in order\n\n1. Create the **Gmail (read-only)** credential in n8n. `docs/MONTHLY_UPDATE.md`\n   walks through the Google Cloud part.\n2. Tell your agent about your company in the chat, so it can save a profile.\n   Nothing runs without one.\n3. Ask it for your monthly update.\n\nThe scheduled monthly run in `73 - TRIGGER` ships switched off. Turn it on\nonly once you have seen an update you are happy with.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -880,
